== S1. la variante ne passe pas par la chaîne
K.b, même objet                          K.b
K.b, chaîne neuve                        K.b
list.K, chaîne neuve                     {a 1} {b 2}
temp.fahrenheit, chaîne                  temp.fahrenheit
S.s "5", chaîne                          S.s
S.s "5", incr                            ERREUR: expected integer but got a list
== S2. une valeur typée invalide
return [list $k 3] : accepté             P
... puis son champ k                     K.b
type cast P : correct                    K.b
== S3. une étiquette relit la valeur par sa chaîne
{k:} sur un K.b                          E.k
sans étiquette : déduit                  K.b
== S4. la durée de vie d'une étiquette dépend de la compilation
return {a:}1                             K.a
eval {return {a:}1}                      ERREUR: return value {K}: value "1" names no variant of the sum K: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {a 1}, or {a:}1
uplevel 0 {return {a:}1}                 ERREUR: return value {K}: value "1" names no variant of the sum K: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {a 1}, or {a:}1
switch -matchvar                         ERREUR: return value {K}: value "5" names no variant of the sum K: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {a 5}, or {a:}5
switch sans -matchvar                    K.a
== S5. les commandes qui reçoivent une étiquette
set {K}k {b:}5                           K.b
proc {{K}x} {b:}5                        K.b
lappend L {b:}3                          K.b
linsert $L end {b:}3                     ERREUR: value "3" names no variant of the sum K: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {a 3}, or {a:}3
dict set D b {b:}2                       ERREUR: value "2" names no variant of the sum K: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {a 2}, or {a:}2
list {b:}5 (perdue)                      
set e {b:}5 (refus)                      ERREUR: local annotation {b:} cannot be stored by "set": it only applies between a caller and the command it calls
== S6. une somme ne se lit pas comme sa variante
lit -> {string}                          on
S.i -> {int}                             ERREUR: value "5" names no variant of the sum S: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {i 5}, or {i:}5
type cast int S.i                        ERREUR: value "5" names no variant of the sum S: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {i 5}, or {i:}5
type cast S K.a                          ERREUR: unknown way to cast the value from K to S
expr sur S.i : permis                    ERREUR: value "5" names no variant of the sum S: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {i 5}, or {i:}5
string length lit : permis               2
== S7. le type d'une variante, à moitié
set {forme.rect}f 2.0 3.0                forme.rect
... f(w)                                 2.0
... f(rect.w)                            2.0
== S8. égalité et clés
K.a 5 eq K.b 5                           0
dict de deux clés                        2
lsearch K.b                              1
== S9. la variante collante
temp.celsius : set t 50.0                ERREUR: value "50.0" names no variant of the sum temp: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {celsius 50.0}, or {celsius:}50.0
S.s abc : set v 5                        ERREUR: value "abc" names no variant of the sum S: a value of a sum is the name of its variant, then its value, as {s abc}, or {s:}abc
== S10. introspection
type get                                 K.b
type get list.K                          list<K>
la variante seule                        b
type is K.b \$k                          ERREUR: wrong # args: should be "type is {question?}type|value"
== S11. grammaire
variante produit à un champ              
produit à un champ seul                  {double}r
== S12. quatre régimes
disjointe : 5, abc                       
recouvrante, sans option                 {celsius fahrenheit}
